1
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,074
This is SettleAI. It makes sure the work was

2
00:00:11,074 --> 00:00:13,847
done before PayPal pays, and it says who is

3
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:15,080
liable when it wasn't.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,917
Ravi runs a small shop. His AI agent can hire

5
00:00:20,917 --> 00:00:23,811
couriers for him, but only within limits he

6
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:26,705
signs: delivery jobs, up to a hundred and

7
00:00:26,705 --> 00:00:27,790
fifty dollars each.

8
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,295
Now the agent tries to book a five hundred

9
00:00:33,295 --> 00:00:35,624
dollar repair job. That's outside the limits.

10
00:00:35,624 --> 00:00:38,951
The check is plain code, not a prompt. It says

11
00:00:38,951 --> 00:00:41,280
no, and why, before any money moves.

12
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:49,234
Inside the limits, the agent books a delivery.

13
00:00:49,234 --> 00:00:51,802
Ravi pays through PayPal checkout, in the

14
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:54,736
sandbox. PayPal holds the money for this job

15
00:00:54,736 --> 00:00:56,570
until the work is proven.

16
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:04,245
The courier sends a photo. Simple rules check

17
00:01:04,245 --> 00:01:07,557
the place, the time, and whether the photo was

18
00:01:07,557 --> 00:01:10,502
used before. Then an AI model checks each

19
00:01:10,502 --> 00:01:12,710
requirement, and the payment is approved.

20
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,156
On a second job, someone sends the same photo

21
00:01:20,156 --> 00:01:22,694
again. It's caught. Nothing is paid, and the

22
00:01:22,694 --> 00:01:25,550
job waits for a person in the review queue.

23
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:35,977
Back on the first job, Ravi says one carton

24
00:01:35,977 --> 00:01:38,838
arrived damaged. An AI arbiter weighs both

25
00:01:38,838 --> 00:01:42,107
sides and writes a liability finding. It cites

26
00:01:42,107 --> 00:01:44,967
the exact clause Ravi signed. Both sides

27
00:01:44,967 --> 00:01:47,010
accept, and PayPal settles it.

28
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:01,691
This is a real job on the PayPal sandbox. The

29
00:02:01,691 --> 00:02:04,065
order, the capture, and both payouts, each

30
00:02:04,065 --> 00:02:05,760
with its own PayPal ID.

31
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,977
Every step is signed into a receipt. Anyone

32
00:02:13,977 --> 00:02:16,655
can check it in the browser, without trusting

33
00:02:16,655 --> 00:02:19,332
us. Change a single character, and the check

34
00:02:19,332 --> 00:02:21,340
fails, and shows what was changed.

35
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:33,240
AI agents are about to spend real money.

36
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,445
SettleAI makes them accountable. Try it

37
00:02:35,445 --> 00:02:37,650
yourself at the link on screen.

